 linuxbsd\r\nAuto-detected 4 CPU cores available for build parallelism. Using 4 cores by default. You can override it with the `-j` or `num_jobs` arguments.\r\nSCU: Generating build files... (max includes per SCU: 1024)\r\nBuilding for platform \"linuxbsd\", architecture \"x86_64\", target \"editor\".\r\n{'PATH': '...', 'HOME': '...', 'PKG_CONFIG_PATH': 'None', 'TERM': 'xterm-256color'}\r\nChecking for C header file mntent.h... (cached) yes\r\nscons: done reading SConscript files.\r\nscons: Building targets ...\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhile I was trying to gather profile data for PGO I had some problems with `PATH` and `LLVM_PROFILE_FILE`. I expected them to have one values but they actually had other values... So having them print in verbose mode should be helpful in some edge case situations","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-12-13T15:34:57Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T20:25:48Z","closed_at":"2026-03-30T19:44:51Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":null,"ref":"scons_env_verbose_print","repo":null,"sha":"a5b1e30d7017a786792cd8800e09f4f5778cacae","user":null},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":15634981,"node_id"